		'The renderer, not app.ts, spots a switch: render.draw compares view.tabs.focused with the tab painted last (undefined -> X at startup is not a switch). frame.build takes `full` and returns `history` (transcript + pending rows); inbox, notice, tab bar and prompt count as chrome. Peak only knows histories that were painted.',
